  <name>Copper Wire IV</name>
  <description>1 effort block peaking at 93% in 90 minutes. Maintain your position on the bike as fatigue tries to change it. This trains your type IIa fibres to function more like endurance fibres. The payoff comes in races when you can hold a pace others can&apos;t.</description>
